NACHTARCHIV · Akte 001 „Die Stimme vor der Tür“ — Peeling Wall & Gold Broadcast Booth demo

Code: written for this film. Small utilities in engine.js (mulberry, h2, vn, fbm, curve/monotone helpers) follow
Lemo-Opuscar styles/gilded-illumination/demo/lib.js; tools from core/ (render, mux, sfx.py) are used in place.
Those parts: Lemo-Opuscar, Copyright (c) 2026 Lemomo (LemoLab), https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar, MIT License
(full text in the library's LICENSE file).

Fonts:
- EB Garamond (SemiBold 600, Medium Italic 500), Copyright 2017 The EB Garamond Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (fonts/OFL-EBGaramond.txt), via @fontsource/eb-garamond.
- DejaVu Sans (phone screen), Bitstream Vera / DejaVu fonts licence (free, redistribution allowed).

Voices: Microsoft Edge text-to-speech (edge-tts): de-DE-ConradNeural (narrator), de-DE-AmalaNeural (the mother's voice), de-DE-KatjaNeural (grandmother).
Whispers and the laugh are made from these voices in audio.py (LPC whisper, cut and pitched syllables).
Music and sound effects: synthesised in audio.py (drone, low strings, Karplus-Strong pluck, heartbeat, wind, creaks, impact). No samples.
